"| 参数 | 位置 | 含义 |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `id` | path | POST /print 的 id。 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status | Answer | Codes |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 200 | Job |  |\n"
"| 404 | No such job | `job_not_found` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status | 响应 | 代码 |\n"
